<title>GERMANY: Fresenius takes over Austrian Laevosan.</title>
<headline>Fresenius takes over Austrian Laevosan.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1996-10-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>German medical products group Fresenius AG said on Friday it had taken a majority stake in Austria's Laevosan GmbH from Raiffeisen Zentralbank Oesterreich AG, and other investors.</p>
<p>In a compulsory statement, the group said the takeover, which is subject to cartel authorities' approval, would improve its market position in Austria. Laevosan had 350 workers in 1995 and sales of 97 million marks.</p>
<p>Laevosan is a maker of pharmaceutical products and also distributes medical products in Austria for international companies.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525</p>
</text>
